- -- INTEGRITY CHECK -- -

	In order to avoid corrupt files you should execute the supplied file
	"PGP-Check". It requires PGP (Pretty Good Privacy - get it from AmiNet),
	version 2.3 or 2.6ui. It adds my public key to your keyring and then
	validates the executables, this docfile and the AmiNet .readme file.


